    `the touching is sexual and the other person consents to the touching` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused obtains that consent by means of an inducement offered or given a threat made or a deception practised for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused obtains that consent where the other person is the accused spouse by means of a threat made or a deception practised for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the other person has a mental disability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knows or could reasonably be expected to know that the other person has a mental disability` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 376G -- incest
    `the accused is of or above 16 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the other person is of or above 16 years of age and is a close family relative being a grandchild child sibling half-sibling parent or grandparent whether or not traced through lawful wedlock` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes or permits a close family relative to penetrate or sexually penetrate the accused` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knows that the other person is a close family relative` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is a person below 18 years of age who is a victim of an offence under section 376AA in respect of the same acts` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 376H -- procurement of sexual activity by deception or false representation
    `the accused fraudulently obtains the other person consent by means of a deception or false representation practised or made for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deception or false representation relates to the use or manner of use of any sexually protective measure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deception or false representation relates to the risk of the other person contracting a sexually transmitted disease from the touching` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knows or has reason to believe that the consent was given in consequence of such deception or false representation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 377 and 377B -- a corpse, and a living animal
    `penetrates or sexually penetrates a human corpse or causes the accused own body to be so penetrated by a human corpse` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes another person to penetrate or sexually penetrate a human corpse or causes that person body to be so penetrated by a human corpse` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that other person did not consent to the penetration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `penetrates with the accused penis the vagina anus or any orifice of an animal or causes or permits the accused vagina anus or mouth to be penetrated by the penis of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes a man to penetrate with his penis the vagina anus or any orifice of an animal or causes the vagina anus or mouth of another person to be penetrated with the penis of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Sexual offences -- images, voyeurism and abuse material, Chapter 16 sections 377BA to 377BO`

DECLARE `Sexual Image` HAS
    -- Section 377BA -- word or gesture intended to insult modesty
    `intending to insult the modesty of any person utters a word makes a sound or gesture or exhibits an object` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intending that such word or sound will be heard or that such gesture or object will be seen by that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intrudes upon the privacy of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 377BB -- voyeurism
    `intentionally observes another person doing a private act without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates equipment with the intention of enabling the accused or another to observe a third person doing a private act without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally or knowingly records another person doing a private act without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates equipment without another person consent with the intention of enabling the accused or another to observe that person genital region breasts if female or buttocks whether exposed or covered in circumstances where they or the underwear would not otherwise be visible` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally or knowingly records without another person consent an image of that person genital region breasts if female or buttocks whether exposed or covered in such circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the other person does not consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `installs equipment or constructs or adapts a structure or part of a structure with the intention of enabling the accused or another to commit an offence under section 377BB(1) to (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 377BC to 377BE -- distributing, possessing and producing images
    `intentionally or knowingly distributes an image or recording of another person without that person consent to the distribution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally or knowingly has in his possession an image or recording of another person for the purpose of distribution without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the image or recording was obtained through the commission of an offence under section 377BB` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the other person does not consent to the distribution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in his possession or has gained access to an image or recording of another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the image or recording is an intimate image or recording` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the possession of or access to it was without the consent of the person depicted` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the possession of or access to it will or is likely to cause humiliation alarm or distress to the person depicted` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally produces an intimate image or recording of another person without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the production will or is likely to cause humiliation alarm or distress to that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally or knowingly distributes an intimate image or recording of another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly threatens the distribution of an intimate image or recording of another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the distribution or threat will or is likely to cause that person humiliation alarm or distress` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 377BF -- sexual exposure
    `for the purpose of obtaining sexual gratification or of causing another person humiliation alarm or distress intentionally exposes the accused genitals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for the purpose of obtaining sexual gratification or of causing another person humiliation alarm or distress intentionally distributes to that person an image of the accused or any other person genitals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the other person will see those genitals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does so without the other person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 377BG to 377BL -- child abuse material and abusive material
    `the material is child abuse material as defined in section 377C(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the material is child abuse material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses a person below 16 years of age for the production of such material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes or procures a person of that age to be so used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `having the care or custody of a person of that age consents to the person being so used or allows the person to be so used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally produces child abuse material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `distributes or sells or offers for sale child abuse material or has it in possession for the purpose of such distribution sale or offer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for the purposes of distributing or selling or offering for sale child abuse material advertises the material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `announces or otherwise makes known by any means an offer or purported offer to acquire buy or gain access to child abuse material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in possession or has gained access to child abuse material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is in a relationship with a person of or above 16 but below 18 years of age that is exploitative of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the material is abusive material of that person as defined in section 377BL(6)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses that person for the production of abusive material or causes or procures that person to be so used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally produces abusive material of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `distributes or sells or offers for sale abusive material of that person or has it in possession for the purpose of such distribution sale or offer` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 377BM and 377BN -- the defences
    `did not intentionally come into possession of or gain access to the image recording or material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on becoming aware took all reasonable steps in the circumstances as soon as practicable to cease possession of or access to it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act was done for the prevention detection investigation or punishment of an offence for the conduct of proceedings or to obtain evidence or for safety or national security` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act was done without intent to cause injury to the person depicted and with reasonable cause` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the image recording or material was not kept for longer than was reasonably necessary or required for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act has a legitimate purpose related to science medicine education or art` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act did not pose an undue risk of harm to any person below 16 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is below 16 years of age and the child abuse material is an image of the accused alone` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was under a mistaken but honest and reasonable belief that reasonable persons would not regard the material as offensive` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 377BO -- child abuse material offences outside or partially outside Singapore
    `the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does outside Singapore an act that would if done in Singapore constitute an offence under section 377BG 377BH or 377BL(2) or (3)` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Proposed Act -- the agent-facing bundle`

DECLARE `Proposed Act` HAS
    `actor` IS AN Actor
    `place of the act` IS A Place
    `place of any other relevant act` IS A Place
    `intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to cause exposure to a risk of loss` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 3: the person is triable here for an act done beyond Singapore
    `the person is liable by law to be tried in Singapore for an offence committed beyond Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 4A: extraterritorial reach for Chapter 6 and Chapter 6B offences
    `the act would constitute an offence under Chapter 6 or Chapter 6B if committed in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 5: this Code does not displace other written law
    `the conduct is or may be punishable under another written law in force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `exception facts` IS AN `Exception Facts`
    `private defence facts` IS A `Private Defence Facts`
    `fault` IS A Fault
    `deception` IS A Deception
    `personal information dealing` IS A `Personal Information Dealing`
    `services obtained` IS A `Services Obtained`
    `fraud conduct` IS A `Fraud Conduct`
    `property taking` IS A `Property Taking`
    `trust` IS A Trust
    `document making` IS A `Document Making`
    `speech` IS A Speech
    `abetment` IS AN Abetment
    `conspiracy` IS A Conspiracy
    `attempt` IS AN Attempt
    `homicide` IS A Homicide
    `bodily harm` IS A `Bodily Harm`
    `personal liberty` IS A `Personal Liberty`
    `unborn and infants` IS AN `Unborn And Infants`
    `kidnapping` IS A Kidnapping
    `sexual context` IS A `Sexual Context`
    `sexual penetration` IS A `Sexual Penetration`
    `sexual image` IS A `Sexual Image`

